1. Removed the TRPCProvider and related mock client since it's not available
2. Kept other essential providers (Session, I18next, Query, Tooltip, Feature)
3. Added a wrapper div with full width to ensure proper layout
4. Maintained the error boundary and suspense boundaries for proper error handling
5. Kept the dynamic import with SSR disabled

This simplified version should work better since we've removed the problematic TRPC provider. The component should now be able to render without the TRPC-related error. If the component itself requires TRPC functionality, it will need to handle those cases gracefully with error boundaries we've provided.

